        <excerpt>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[CX Outsourcing Buyer Guide Decision Lab Active Ask Better. See Further. The questions that reveal the right CX partner. The strongest outsourcing decisions are not built on polished proposals alone. They are built on questions that reveal how a partner will protect your brand, operate under pressure and improve the customer experience over time. Operating [&hellip;]]]></Value>
